@base = http://localhost:3000
@bot = bot-01

### Health / overview
GET {{base}}/health
GET {{base}}/api/v1/overview
GET {{base}}/api/v1/bots

### Bot control
POST {{base}}/api/v1/bots/{{bot}}/commands
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: bot-01-restart-001
X-Actor: local-operator

{"command":"restart"}

### Kill switch
POST {{base}}/api/v1/system/kill-switch
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled":false}

### Create an order, then confirm payment to queue it
POST {{base}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-order-1001

{"externalOrderId":"DEMO-1001","amount":1250,"currency":"THB","payload":{"sku":"demo"}}

POST {{base}}/api/v1/orders/DEMO-1001/pay
Content-Type: application/json

{"provider":"demo"}

### Atomic order claim
POST {{base}}/api/v1/orders/claim
Content-Type: application/json

{"botId":"bot-01"}

### Finish an order using its numeric id
POST {{base}}/api/v1/orders/1/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"COMPLETED","result":{"reference":"demo-ref"}}

### Inspect
GET {{base}}/api/v1/orders
GET {{base}}/api/v1/bots/{{bot}}/logs
GET {{base}}/api/v1/audit
GET {{base}}/api/v1/deployments

### Package upload: curl -F "version=1.0.1" -F "file=@./bot.zip" http://localhost:3000/api/v1/deployments/packages
### Deploy: POST /api/v1/deployments {"packageId":1,"botId":"bot-01"} (omit botId for all enabled bots)
